# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Paths that do not belong in this repository.
#
# Design records, planning notes, session notes and test data are kept outside it. The
# entries below are a second line of defence: a file recreated at one of these paths is
# ignored rather than committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Markdown is kept only at the named documents in the root, under .github/, LICENSES/,
# manuscript/README.md and in vendor/ folders. Any other Markdown file, or a copy of one, is
# ignored: a note, a tool's instruction file, or its outputs. This block comes first, and each
# exception names Markdown files only, so the rules for the design record and session files
# below still apply inside those places.
*.md
*.md.*
*.mdc
*.markdown
!/README.md
!/INSTALL.md
!/GETTING_STARTED.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/COMMUNITY.md
!/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/GOVERNANCE.md
!/SUPPORT.md
!/.github/**/*.md
!/LICENSES/**/*.md
!/manuscript/README.md
!**/vendor/**/*.md

# The line after docs/ lets the documentation generators in tools/docs/ be tracked.
docs/
!/tools/docs/
experiments/
Test_Data/
Notes and planning/
Former Codebases/
*_PLANNING.md
*_PROMPT.md
*KICKOFF.md
*HANDOFF.md
SESSION*.md
DECISIONS.md
GLOSSARY.md

# Hidden folders hold one tool's or one person's settings, worktrees and caches. The
# project's only hidden folder is .github, which is kept.
.*/
!.github/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.env

# Tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# Editors and platforms
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Ingence project artifacts produced by a run
/runs/
/.tmp/
/CURRENT

# The explorer's build tools; its built output under src/ingence/web/explorer/ is committed
node_modules/
